Update the admin assets build: node 21 to node 26.10.0, AdminLTE 3.1 to 4.9, Bootstrap 4 to 5.3, Font Awesome 5 to 7, and the webpack loaders and plugins to current releases. Dependencies that AdminLTE no longer bundles are now declared explicitly, unused build dependencies were removed, and the admin templates use the AdminLTE 4 layout and Bootstrap 5 markup. The jQuery, Select2, and DataTables stack was replaced by Tom Select and native table controls, with the existing table translations migrated to the admin locale catalogs.
